over the last decade, the word woke.

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:05.071
You've heard it a lot
in the last couple of years.

00:00:05.071 --> 00:00:08.141
It's gone from what was a battlecry,
a prominent hashtag used by Black Lives

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:09.709
Matter protesters.

00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:10.910
To a political buzzword.

00:00:10.910 --> 00:00:14.681
It's a catchall umbrella term
that seemingly is used to describe

00:00:14.681 --> 00:00:17.250
people on ideas that conservatives
just don't like.

00:00:17.684 --> 00:00:20.520
The thing is, even former
President Trump is acknowledging that

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:24.691
the word has really lost its meaning
as he continues to use it.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:28.628
And I don't like the term work
because I hear work.

00:00:28.628 --> 00:00:31.965
Work well connotes, I guess, a term that
used half the people can't even define it.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:32.732
They don't know what it is.

00:00:32.732 --> 00:00:35.902
But of things going on with our military,
with the Woke and all this nonsense

00:00:35.902 --> 00:00:40.407
and they're not learning to fight
and protect us from some very bad people.

00:00:41.074 --> 00:00:42.909
They want to go
woke. They want to go woke.

00:00:45.645 --> 00:00:46.446
An irony there, but.

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:47.647
Yes, yes.

00:00:47.647 --> 00:00:50.850
Let's bring in CNN political commentator
and New York magazine columnist

00:00:50.884 --> 00:00:52.719
Errol Louis. Errol, good morning.

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:56.489
Do you think it is
ironic that now we have Republicans

00:00:56.489 --> 00:01:00.193
arguing among themselves
about what woke is and what woke isn't?

00:01:00.193 --> 00:01:02.529
Because I'm old enough to remember
just a few years ago

00:01:02.529 --> 00:01:04.864
when woke with something
very different Yes.

00:01:04.864 --> 00:01:08.501
Yes. Those are 36 months ago,
an entirely new, different universe.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.704
Well, yeah,
look, it's it's typical of Trump

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:15.809
