as it suits him in the moment.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:16.943
He can do that.

00:01:16.943 --> 00:01:20.346
He can execute those kind of flip flops
within one speech, actually.

00:01:20.547 --> 00:01:23.883
And his followers
are not that interested in the niceties

00:01:23.883 --> 00:01:26.986
or the particular is of being consistent
about this or that term.

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:29.022
And so look what he has done.

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:33.359
And I, I can't believe that the Republican
challengers don't quite get this yet,

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:36.262
but what he has done
since 20, 15, since 2016,

00:01:36.496 --> 00:01:39.699
or throughout his political career,
what he has done is just redefined

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:41.501
and scrambled. What politics is

00:01:42.535 --> 00:01:44.971
the the De Santos's eyes of the world.

