00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:49.402
whatever ills you or bothers you on
whatever is different,

00:02:49.435 --> 00:02:54.574
either how someone feels or looks,
whatever it may be, So it's become also

00:02:55.208 --> 00:03:00.280
when I see it, it's become this effort to
run on exclusion as opposed to inclusion.

00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:03.583
And it seems sadly effective
Oh, yeah, it's very effective.

